PRO FORMA FIRST PARTNERS' RESOLUTION

WHEREAS the establishment of a Limited Partnership is required for the provision of commercial inspection and testing services under ISIC 7120;

RESOLVED to adopt the Limited Partnership Agreement in the form attached hereto, committing the following capital contributions: General Partner - CAD 10,000; Limited Partners - CAD 5,000 each;

RESOLVED to establish the registered office at Suite 300, 865 Hornby Street, Vancouver, BC V6Z 2C3;

RESOLVED to appoint [General Partner Name] as the General Partner and [Officer Name] as the Managing Partner;

RESOLVED to authorize the filing of Form LP1 with the Registrar of Companies and all related statutory documents;

RESOLVED that the officers of the General Partner be appointed as per the corporate charter.

This resolution confirms the formation, governance, and operational setup for the On-Site Factory Pre-Shipment Quality Control and Audit Agency. (Word count: 98)
